From 6cc947048e1141b9225bd8ab42bf8b63846d94ea Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Mon, 16 Nov 2026 08:20:09 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 5/5] Make scanning lighter

- Prefs.profiles() parsed its JSON on every call (several times per scan); it
  now reparses only when the stored text changes.
- A scan asked the window list and each window's root twice, and the keyboard
  position once per box per scan and per frame. Roots are looked up once per
  scan and the keyboard position at most every 250 ms.
- The overlay redraws only when the items changed, and the privacy indicator
  no longer allocates a Paint on every frame.
